\newlabel{tab:main_results}{{1}{18}{Hypervolume (HV) on the synthetic non-stationary MO environment at 100K steps (5 seeds). Mode anchors are $w_0{=}[0.85,0.15]$, $w_1{=}[0.15,0.85]$, $w_2{=}[0.5,0.5]$. Reference point $(-5,-5)$. Bold = best per column; BAMOR dominates Mode~1 (skewed cone, $+28.2\%$ over Uniform) and wins on three of four columns.\relax }{table.caption.1}{}}
