\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Overall HV during training. Shaded bands are $\pm 1$ std over 5 seeds. BAMOR exhibits a characteristic mid-training dip between 30K--60K steps, corresponding to the phase in which the cone estimator is still accumulating statistics and the policy is temporarily over-specialising to a stale anchor. After the cone stabilises, BAMOR recovers and surpasses all baselines at 100K. Uniform is flat by construction; Fixed-weight is permanently trapped.\relax }}{20}{figure.caption.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:training_curves}{{2}{20}{Overall HV during training. Shaded bands are $\pm 1$ std over 5 seeds. BAMOR exhibits a characteristic mid-training dip between 30K--60K steps, corresponding to the phase in which the cone estimator is still accumulating statistics and the policy is temporarily over-specialising to a stale anchor. After the cone stabilises, BAMOR recovers and surpasses all baselines at 100K. Uniform is flat by construction; Fixed-weight is permanently trapped.\relax }{figure.caption.3}{}}
